on't be mean, 416. We're lucky that she's here to help."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"G11","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Sigh) I'm only looking out for her. If you consider what 45 put us through earlier..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP45","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nevermind that. SPP-1 has important information for us, doesn't she?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SPP1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"SPP-1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Y-yes... Helian contacted me earlier and said you guys are looking for the coordinates of the jammer?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SPP1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You...already know where it is?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SPP1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ha! We haven't been this lucky in a long time! I thought we were cursed for life!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SPP1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G11","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let me hug you, Goddess of Luck!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SPP1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{